OL,3,APhilippines' Duterte seen in person for
OL,4,Afirst time at International Criminal
OL,5,ACourt
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Philippine President Rodrigo
OL,8,FDuterte has appeared in person at the
OL,9,FInternational Criminal Court in The
OL,10,FHague, where he is due to be tried for
OL,11,Falleged crimes against humanity.
OL,13,FHe is facing charges over his bloody
OL,14,Fwar on drugs, which saw tens of
OL,15,Fthousands of small-time drug dealers
OL,16,Fallegedly executed summarily.
OL,18,FThe 81-year-old wore a dark suit and
OL,19,Fwhite shirt with no tie on Wednesday,
OL,20,Fthe first time he has been seen in
OL,21,Fperson since his arrest in Manila 18
OL,22,Fmonths ago.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
